### Delete produk gagal: supervisor — harapan 403 "anda tidak memiliki akses: products:delete"
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSupervisor.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Get produk gagal: id bukan UUID — harapan 400 "id harus berupa UUID"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/123
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Get produk gagal: UUID tidak ada — harapan 404 "produk tidak ditemukan"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{$guid}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Delete produk — harapan 204 (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Get produk setelah dihapus — harapan 404 "produk tidak ditemukan"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{createProduct.response.body.$.data.id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

# =====================================================================
# Warehouses — /api/v1/warehouses
# Read: semua role, tapi data dibatasi gudang milik user (WarehouseScope).
# Create: superadmin saja. Gudang di luar scope dianggap tidak ada (404).
# =====================================================================

### List warehouse superadmin — harapan 200, semua gudang (minimal 3 dari seeder)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### List warehouse supervisor — harapan 200, total 2 (Malang & Surabaya-01)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSupervisor.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### List warehouse staff Malang — harapan 200, total 1 (WH-MALANG-01)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStaffMalang.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Cari WH-SURABAYA-01 — ID-nya dipakai request di bawah
# @name whSurabaya
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses?search=WH-SURABAYA-01
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Get warehouse by id — harapan 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses/{{whSurabaya.response.body.$.data[0].id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### List lokasi warehouse — harapan 200, RAK-B-01..RAK-B-03
# @name locSurabaya
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses/{{whSurabaya.response.body.$.data[0].id}}/locations
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Get warehouse sebagai supervisor — harapan 200 (Surabaya-01 ada di scope-nya)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses/{{whSurabaya.response.body.$.data[0].id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSupervisor.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Get warehouse gagal: staff Malang buka gudang Surabaya — harapan 404 "warehouse tidak ditemukan"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses/{{whSurabaya.response.body.$.data[0].id}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStaffMalang.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### List lokasi gagal: staff Malang buka gudang Surabaya — harapan 404 "warehouse tidak ditemukan"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses/{{whSurabaya.response.body.$.data[0].id}}/locations
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginStaffMalang.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Get warehouse gagal: id bukan UUID — harapan 400 "id harus berupa UUID"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses/bukan-uuid
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Create warehouse — harapan 201 (dijalankan kedua kali -> 409, belum ada endpoint delete)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "code": "WH-SIDOARJO-01",
  "name": "Gudang Sidoarjo Waru",
  "address": "Jl. Raya Waru No. 1, Sidoarjo"
}

### Create warehouse gagal: kode duplikat — harapan 409 "kode warehouse sudah dipakai"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "code": "WH-MALANG-01",
  "name": "Gudang Malang Duplikat"
}

### Create warehouse gagal: validasi — harapan 422 dengan errors.code & errors.name
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "address": "Tanpa kode dan nama"
}

### Create warehouse gagal: supervisor — harapan 403 "anda tidak memiliki akses: warehouses:create"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginSupervisor.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

{
  "code": "WH-GRESIK-01",
